<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on SMH bearer shares.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on SMH bearer shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank J.Vontobel &amp; Co AG said it has issued three million call warrants, on SMH bearer shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 25 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    875 CHF		   PREMIUM	13.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.55 CHF		  GEARING	7.6 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 15.JAN.97-19.AUG.98   PAYDATE	15.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXHANGE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  870 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
